          "class": "S",
          "consent": "Lets Home Assistant use this TV as an ESPHome Bluetooth proxy: the TV listens on the home network with the key from ble-link and passes on the Bluetooth advertisements it hears nearby, in short windows that leave the radio to the remote. It only listens: it never connects to a device.",
