          "class": "S",
          "consent": "Sends this TV's state to Home Assistant as sensors of its ESPHome device: power and screen, the app in front and its input, the picture mode, the Live TV Tuner and its signal, the chip's temperature, the load and the free memory. Read only: nothing on the TV can be changed through it. It uses the Bluetooth proxy's link (ble-link).",
